\title{CoRSIVtools: CoRSIV-focused DNA methylation analysis}
\description{
Restricts DNA methylation array analysis to correlated regions of systemic interindividual variation (CoRSIVs). It maps array probes to CoRSIVs for any array given a probe manifest, summarises methylation per CoRSIV, tests differential methylation with limma under arbitrary covariate designs, and compares CoRSIV results against matched random control regions, the rest of the array, or user-supplied control regions.
